# records of 3a75246ce0d87d8e
# What Link has proven of a parameter holds of whatever a call hands over, and the Body of the callee is typed by it. The walk's own type of the operand may say less: here a method of a list gives it.
# Code has no way to state a type. So in front of a copy the type is tested for, and the failing side traps: it has no closed arm, and only a false claim of Link takes it.
# RUN: walk f2 mechanisms=all
# CHECK-LABEL: code f2:Body
# CHECK: frame 1 callee=f1
# CHECK: [[element]]: anything{{*}} = Call
# CHECK: [[test]]: boolean {{*}} = TypeTest [[element]] testedType=
# CHECK: = Narrowed [[element]], [[test]]
# CHECK: Unreachable
# CHECK: = Mul {{*}} form=Numbers
# RUN(WITHHELD): walk f2 mechanisms=all-Arrivals
# WITHHELD-NOT: Unreachable

